{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"c06678e1a3b1e8e5d50a58fdea57582ac2740a050b9ce3805169acbdf42c8519"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:12b41bf6c3b9e64b03424baaeb345ac0882983b0a4df5b33f25c3f6233a22109","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A few pets by then","evidence":"[D12:1 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?\n[D24:2 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: Hi Audrey! Pets really can make our lives better, huh? Speaking of which, I've got some awesome news -- I recently adopted another pup from a shelter. He's the best.\n[D28:6 | 9:02 am on 22 November, 2023] Andrew: No, we haven't got the chance to take them to the groomer yet. But will do that soon! So guess what, I can't help myself but to adpot another dog the other day. Here's a photo of the doggo!","itemId":"urn:uuid:139cd3b5-9dca-5f5f-994e-eff705a9a051","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0a524d71ed66ec1e94a9ef3aab600c4e1925476a528bb34ebe2605db40f2b881","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many pets will Andrew have, as of December 2023?","referenceAnswer":"three","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0a524d71ed66ec1e94a9ef3aab600c4e1925476a528bb34ebe2605db40f2b881"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}